{"id":"5b7ca526c5d0bb9a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-strengthened-liar.md","title":"加强说谎者句子","display":"df-strengthened-liar — 加强说谎者句子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-strengthened-liar","aliases":["91-df-strengthened-liar","91-df-liar-star"],"display":"df-strengthened-liar — 加强说谎者句子","depends_on":["[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-strengthened-liar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-strengthened-liar</span><span>91-df-liar-star</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strengthened-liar — 加强说谎者句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cac035693aea2791\" href=\"?note=cac035693aea2791\" title=\"91-df-liar-sentence\">91-df-liar-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" href=\"?note=ec1d9c6fcc3c0767\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth\">91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-strengthened-liar-—-加强说谎者句子-$\\lambda^$\">df-strengthened-liar — 加强说谎者句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span> (可表示句法运算的算术背景理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\)</span> (该背景理论满足对角引理)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\n\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda^*\\,\n\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda^*\\,\n\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span> : 加强说谎者句子（strengthened liar sentence）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\\)</span> : &quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span>的否定是真的&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>加强说谎者的含义：\n加强说谎者句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span> 断言“我的否定是真的”。“加强”指这种表达直接调用负真理信息，并不表示仅靠固定点等价就已推出矛盾。</p>\n<p>普通说谎者 vs 加强说谎者：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>句子</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>悖论结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>普通说谎者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;我是假的&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加强说谎者<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\">\\(\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;我的否定是真的&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>加强说谎者的悖论推导：\n若额外把 T-模式非法扩展到含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\lambda^*\">\\(\\neg\\lambda^*\\)</span>，才可推出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^* \\quad \\mathrm{(T\\text{-}schema)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^* \\quad \\mathrm{(T\\text{-}schema)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow \\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Rightarrow \\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>矛盾！</p>\n<p>加强说谎者在真理理论中的处理：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB/UTB</td>\n<td>固定点句可构造，但基础语言双条件不适用于它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*\">\\(\\lambda^*\\)</span>在间隙中，不满足T-schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>由受控捕获/释放规则处理，不能仅凭定义判为不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>加强说谎者的理论意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加强说谎者是测试真理理论的关键案例</li>\n<li>对加强说谎者的处理体现理论对悖论的态度</li>\n<li>某些理论可能无法安全处理加强说谎者</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-strengthened-liar-—-加强说谎者句子-$\\lambda^$","text":"df-strengthened-liar — 加强说谎者句子 $\\lambda^*$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-liar-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-liar-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","status":"resolved","id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*)\n\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^*\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{PA}_T\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\lambda^*\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda^*\\urcorner})\n\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strengthened\\text{-}liar}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_{T}(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda^*\\,\n\\operatorname{StrongLiar}_{\\mathrm{PA}_T,T}(\\lambda^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\lambda \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\lambda^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\lambda^* \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^* \\quad \\mathrm{(T\\text{-}schema)}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow \\lambda^* \\leftrightarrow \\neg \\lambda^*","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda^*","display":false}],"bytes":2641,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-strengthened-liar]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-stren